================================================================================
STEP 4 — df cache (process-level, mirroring src/rag_v1/query_cache.py)
================================================================================

Key on (snapshot_id, chunk_set_id, tsquery_text) — the NORMALIZED tsquery, not
the raw term, so two raw terms that normalize together share one entry and
cannot diverge. Values are exact integer counts over a frozen snapshot, so a
hit is bit-identical to a recomputation by construction.

Ship this last: it is the smallest win and the only one carrying state across
queries, so a failure here is easiest to attribute when nothing else is moving.
